# Allowlist, not denylist.
#
# This directory is also where vendor skills install themselves (graphify arrives via `uv tool`
# and writes into both ~/.claude/skills and ~/.codex/skills on its own schedule). A denylist would
# silently start tracking the next one that shows up. So: ignore everything at the top level, then
# name the six skills this repository actually owns.
#
# Adding a skill to this repository is therefore a deliberate line here, which is the point.

/*

!/.gitignore
!/README.md

!/progressive-disclosure
!/agent-personas
!/agent-persona-factory
!/execution-methodology
!/graph-navigation
!/project-onboarding

# Never, anywhere.
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.pyo
.DS_Store
